{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6496607219baa57557448fde7b0706f6f6666bde3fdabc8a4cc918619ea59c1e", "ja": "（クリスマス公演、初日が無事終わった。\nあとは、明日の準備を……ん？）", "zh": "（圣诞公演的第一天顺利结束了。\n接下来要替明天做准备……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1002_p", "source_sha256": "366727c86394c78fa17fd287ff006c97ca9d278dfa7c1efa419fa878996699f7", "ja": "あ、杏奈？\nどうしたんだ、こんなところで……。", "zh": "啊，杏奈？\n怎么啦？为什么待在这种地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "df0eea8c9185a67f314120cd78f34d4418c14546b8234a908fef7cf2517779af", "ja": "ん……あ、{$P$}、さん……。\nごめんなさい、ビックリさせて……。", "zh": "嗯……啊，{$P$}先生……\n对不起，吓到你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "e6be04a72125eb6fe9dfb07ac6c9158b3283960a1b40ca669aaf487489087e80", "ja": "杏奈、少し疲れちゃったから……\n隅っこで、ボーッとしてました……。", "zh": "因为杏奈有点累……\n所以，就在角落发呆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "43e6be0ae866bfd4d30e3dabd0093b6a12bf48526d0d63b1c83ed407ea83e8b3", "ja": "ここ……なんとなく、落ち着く……。", "zh": "这里……不知道为什么，让人很安心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1006_p", "source_sha256": "eee7a432c4edf885f29aebb3e7457c8b83aa163b955ed3211e94d5928498b3e8", "ja": "そ、そうか……だからって、いつまでもここにいたら\n風邪をひくぞ。控え室に戻って、着替えような。", "zh": "这、这样啊……话虽如此，一直待在这里会感冒的。\n快回准备室换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "d89e8606992e78b99d8cd48c43580a96e7f9b83388d58c6e5bbcc04e7102ee42", "ja": "うん……。\nあのね、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "嗯……\n那个，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1008_p", "source_sha256": "edd75d42bad236064e1b53c77650a3da3afe19e724b0cd34b4e8084f7a12add6", "ja": "なんだ？", "zh": "怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "3db2fb11313382bec05c7a253b03505bca10fc4c4a11fd95804becf0babcbccc", "ja": "ライブ、すごく楽しかった……。\nステージが、キラキラ眩しくて……ドキドキした……。", "zh": "演唱会非常开心……\n舞台闪闪发光……让杏奈心跳不已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "0587c2761e43bd057b14432dd9ebb204079341cd8e41c91bf120878080253d21", "ja": "ステージから見た、みんなも……笑ってた……。\nお客さん……楽しんでくれた、かな……？", "zh": "从舞台上看下去，大家也都……带着笑容……\n不知道观众们……是不是也看得很开心呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f563b05c080365f2c894282b3a2a264679f4e258db53eaa1400fb253c04f44e8", "ja": "もちろん！　みんな楽しそうだったよ。\n杏奈も、他のみんなも、お客さんも……。", "zh": "那当然！大家看起来都很开心喔。\n不论是杏奈、其他成员跟观众们都一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1012_p", "source_sha256": "125e07218c91a1656047a9775a434f28908fc4425b66c35bcc0dc34cc8b77f31", "ja": "掛け値なしに、いいステージだった。\n誇りに思っていいと思うよ。", "zh": "这是场棒到极点的表演，我这么说绝不夸张。\n你应该为此感到骄傲才是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "2272729306e4a80a08198dbc4cafb8283b180a288c7d34738cdfc4b70bed0301", "ja": "ん……♪　じゃあ、ひとつだけ……\nお願い、聞いてくれますか……？", "zh": "嗯……♪那，杏奈有个请求……\n你愿意听听吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7977c5ea648a48aa26266f8c8cf9c49063ee0828ce12be3a1f9d93420d9eb2c1", "ja": "お願い？　なんだ？", "zh": "请求？是什么请求？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "a0f67237dc325392f61456847eace215599b73891b3ca83013bb87c292a518e5", "ja": "来年のクリスマスも……{$P$}さんと\n一緒に、過ごしたい……です。", "zh": "希望明年的圣诞节……也能\n和{$P$}先生一起度过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "dd0356c1321c08aaffe50e3a0d7ea65d6d194b97affb230fa414ad3f230429ca", "ja": "杏奈の、お願い……聞いてくれますか……？", "zh": "你愿意……答应杏奈的请求吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6ee04b505457e74cd4c18d1d26494a3974120ffee20101f8717baa591c251b5f", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n来年も、楽しいクリスマスにしような！", "zh": "嗯，那当然。\n明年也要度过一场开心的圣诞节喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0044_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "e21fcbb0e6897e68b262763f198f7f6ad2b6c32df6b6a6675ad2a30450ab4b95", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}さん……。\n大好き……♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生……\n最喜欢你了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
